=== Ecuador ===
The final 23-player squad was announced on 1 June 2015. On 1 June 2015, midfielder [[Michael Arroyo]] sustained an ankle injury and was ruled out of the tournament, being replaced by [[Pedro Larrea]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.ecuafutbol.org/web/noticia.php?idn=7292&idc=2#.VW4BiNJ_NHw|title=NÓMINA OFICIAL DE LA TRI PARA LA COPA AMÉRICA 2015|date=1 June 2015|access-date=26 May 2015|publisher=Mediotiempo}}</ref> On 3 June 2015, midfielder [[Antonio Valencia]] was ruled out of the tournament after undergoing urgent ankle surgery.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2015/jun/03/manchester-united-antonio-valencia-miss-ecuador-copa-america|title=Manchester United's Antonio Valencia to miss Copa América|date=3 June 2015|access-date=3 June 2015|work=The Guardian}}</ref> On 11 June 2015, forward [[Jaime Ayoví]] was ruled out due to a muscle strain and was replaced by [[Daniel Angulo]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.ca2015.com/en/news/injured-jaime-ayovi-replaced-by-daniel-angulo-in-ecuador-squad/1vpu5p69b9sf61g3cwo142craq|title=Injured Jaime Ayoví replaced by Daniel Angulo in Ecuador squad|date=11 June 2015|access-date=11 June 2015|publisher=Copa América 2015}}</ref>

