== Group C ==

=== Brazil ===
The final 23-player squad was announced on 5 May 2015. On 24 May 2015, goalkeeper [[Diego Alves]] sustained a knee injury and was ruled out of the tournament, being replaced by goalkeeper [[Neto (footballer, born 1989)|Neto]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.beinsports.tv/news/title/diego-alves-ruled-out-of-copa-america-with-serious-knee-injury/article/ivb6fgx6zy7q1mbzami83novx|title=Diego Alves Ruled Out of Copa America With Serious Knee Injury|date=24 May 2015|access-date=26 May 2015|publisher=beIN Sports|archive-date=26 May 2015|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150526194417/http://www.beinsports.tv/news/title/diego-alves-ruled-out-of-copa-america-with-serious-knee-injury/article/ivb6fgx6zy7q1mbzami83novx|url-status=dead}}</ref> On 29 May 2015, defender [[Marcelo (footballer, born 1988)|Marcelo]] sustained a back injury and was ruled out of the tournament, being replaced by defender [[Geferson]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://selecao.cbf.com.br/noticias/selecao-masculina/geferson-do-internacional-e-convocado-para-a-copa-america#.VWj8HtJ_Oko|title=Geferson, do Internacional, é convocado para a Copa América|trans-title=Internacional's Geferson chosen for the Copa América|date=29 May 2015|access-date=29 May 2015|publisher=CBF|language=pt|archive-date=10 June 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160610235318/http://selecao.cbf.com.br/noticias/selecao-masculina/geferson-do-internacional-e-convocado-para-a-copa-america#.VWj8HtJ_Oko|url-status=dead}}</ref> On 2 June 2015, midfielder [[Luiz Gustavo]] was ruled out of the tournament due to pending surgery to correct a meniscus injury, being replaced by midfielder [[Fred (footballer, born 1993)|Fred]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.espnfc.com/brazil/story/2476421/luiz-gustavo-to-miss-copa-america-due-to-knee-surgery|title=Brazil's Luiz Gustavo to miss Copa America due to knee surgery|date=2 June 2015|access-date=2 June 2015|publisher=ESPNFC}}</ref> On 11 June 2015, [[Danilo (footballer, born July 1991)|Danilo]] was withdrawn from the squad after picking up an injury in Brazil's [[Exhibition game#Association football|friendly]] match against Mexico. He was replaced by [[Dani Alves]].<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.goal.com/en/news/584/brazil/2015/06/11/12609222/dani-alves-joins-brazils-copa-america-squad|title=Dani Alves joins Brazil's Copa America squad|date=11 June 2015|access-date=11 June 2015|website=Goal.com}}</ref>

